{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0b350b4fcbc15432","type":"text","text":"# Unifying Messaging\nEach project creates access, representation, and care for underrepresented communities through culture, health, education, and self-expression.","x":-620,"y":-70,"width":325,"height":203},
		{"id":"0ac9933e8f218843","type":"text","text":"# Core Theme\nA community-centered creative ecosystem using music, wellness, and affirming resources to help people feel seen, supported, inspired, and connected.","x":-620,"y":-323,"width":329,"height":203},
		{"id":"d712cd58d3853fd9","type":"text","text":"# Dai's Brand Ecosystem","x":-200,"y":-120,"width":233,"height":50,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a6982629e4c9592c","type":"text","text":"# Music Services\n","x":120,"y":-575,"width":181,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ec593af446424af0","type":"text","text":"**Key Message**\nMusic is more than entertainment. It is a tool for connection, education, representation, and community-building.","x":340,"y":-720,"width":634,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"72cfb4e3ff91bff5","type":"text","text":"**Audience**\n- Music lovers\n- Queer communities\n- Underground music fans\n- Event organizers\n- Artists and creatives\n- People interested in music education and discovery","x":340,"y":-575,"width":434,"height":260},
		{"id":"83ed50a6eb424395","type":"text","text":"**Core Purpose**\n- Give underrepresented artists a platform\n- Share underground and queer music\n- Inspire people to explore music more deeply\n- Build community through sound, education, and shared experiences","x":820,"y":-575,"width":400,"height":260},
		{"id":"17151b951ae241a8","type":"text","text":"### Call to Actions\n- Listen to the catalogue\n- Book DJ services\n- Explore underground and queer artists\n- Attend events\n- Support the community\n- Deepen their understanding of music and other people","x":1248,"y":-575,"width":519,"height":250},
		{"id":"fe42627b61acb8b4","type":"text","text":"**Content Suggestions**\n- Artist spotlights\n- Queer and underground music recommendations\n- DJ set clips\n- Music education posts\n- Event recaps\n- “Songs you should know” series\n- Behind-the-scenes of production or performance","x":1276,"y":-895,"width":463,"height":275},
